==> Documenting mTLS rotation guidance
  Linkerd auto-rotates proxy certificates every 24 hours.
  The trust anchor (root CA) has a default validity of 365 days.
  To manually rotate the trust anchor: linkerd upgrade --identity-trust-anchors-file <new-ca.crt>
  Proxy certificate rotation is transparent — no pod restarts needed.
  mTLS is mandatory (always-on) in Linkerd; there is no 'permissive' mode.
